('RTN041','Pick one keeper','Choose one Move from the last three weeks that genuinely improved a moment between you. Mark that one as worth repeating.','Selecting a behavior that produced a useful result makes repetition intentional rather than relying on memory.','KEEP',ARRAY['reinforcement','self_monitoring']::text[],ARRAY['anywhere']::text[],2,1,false,false,'high','high','{"routine":1}'::jsonb,ARRAY[4]::integer[],ARRAY['requires_prior_completed_move']::text[],'{"quality_attention":0.25,"shared_experience":0.25}'::jsonb),
('RTN042','Attach it to a cue','Take one Keeper and decide exactly when it will happen again: after coffee, when you get home, on the walk to the shop, or before sleep.','Putting a Keeper after something you already do makes it easier to remember.','KEEP',ARRAY['cue_association','implementation_intention']::text[],ARRAY['home','walking','commuting','anywhere']::text[],2,1,false,false,'high','high','{"routine":1}'::jsonb,ARRAY[4]::integer[],ARRAY['requires_keeper']::text[],'{"anticipation":0.2}'::jsonb),
('RTN043','Make it smaller','Take a Move you liked but found hard to repeat. Reduce it until it feels almost too easy to skip: twenty minutes becomes five; a big plan becomes one question.','Reducing friction makes repetition more likely and helps separate the useful behavior from unnecessary effort.','KEEP',ARRAY['environmental_design','repetition','implementation_intention']::text[],ARRAY['home','outdoors','anywhere']::text[],3,1,false,false,'high','high','{"routine":1}'::jsonb,ARRAY[4]::integer[],ARRAY['requires_prior_move']::text[],'{"shared_experience":0.2}'::jsonb),
('RTN044','Repeat the warmer hello','Repeat the warmer hello from earlier in the Routine: stop, look up, and use a form of touch that is already normal and welcome between you.','Repeating the same warm hello helps it become part of how you reconnect.','KEEP',ARRAY['cue_association','repetition','attention']::text[],ARRAY['home','cafe_or_bar','travel','anywhere']::text[],1,1,false,true,'high','high','{"routine":1,"closeness":0.7}'::jsonb,ARRAY[4]::integer[],ARRAY['touch_not_welcome']::text[],'{"physical_affection":1,"quality_attention":0.6,"verbal_affection":0.3}'::jsonb),
('RTN045','Protect five minutes','Choose one five-minute window that worked well for you: coffee, after dinner, a walk, before bed. Make it deliberately phone-free again today.','Protecting the same five minutes again makes focused time easier to repeat.','KEEP',ARRAY['environmental_design','repetition','attention']::text[],ARRAY['home','walking','cafe_or_bar']::text[],5,1,false,true,'high','high','{"routine":1,"closeness":0.6}'::jsonb,ARRAY[4]::integer[],ARRAY['on_call_or_urgent_contact']::text[],'{"quality_attention":0.9,"shared_experience":0.2}'::jsonb),
('RTN046','Keep the outside ritual','Pick one outside ritual you could realistically repeat weekly: a walk, coffee stop, market lap, bench, or errand detour. Do it or choose when you''ll do it next.','Attaching connection to an existing place or routine lowers the effort needed to repeat it.','KEEP',ARRAY['cue_association','shared_activity','implementation_intention']::text[],ARRAY['walking','outdoors','cafe_or_bar','shopping_or_errands']::text[],10,2,true,true,'high','high','{"routine":1,"spark":0.4,"closeness":0.5}'::jsonb,ARRAY[4]::integer[],ARRAY['mobility_or_financial_constraints']::text[],'{"anticipation":0.2,"shared_experience":1}'::jsonb),
('RTN047','Keep the question','Choose one question that opened a better conversation this month. Ask it again in a new context rather than searching for a brand-new technique.','A question that worked once is worth using again. Familiarity can make good conversation easier, not less meaningful.','KEEP',ARRAY['repetition','curiosity','reinforcement']::text[],ARRAY['home','walking','car','text_or_remote']::text[],3,1,false,true,'high','high','{"routine":0.9,"communication":0.8,"closeness":0.6}'::jsonb,ARRAY[4]::integer[],ARRAY[]::text[],'{"curiosity":1,"emotional_conversation":0.7}'::jsonb),
('RTN048','Plan for the bad day','Choose one Keeper and finish this sentence privately: ''Even on a busy or bad day, I can still do the two-minute version by…''','Planning a minimum version protects a new behavior when motivation and time are low.','KEEP',ARRAY['implementation_intention','environmental_design']::text[],ARRAY['home','workday','commuting','anywhere']::text[],2,1,false,false,'high','high','{"routine":1}'::jsonb,ARRAY[4]::integer[],ARRAY['requires_keeper']::text[],'{"shared_experience":0.2}'::jsonb),
('RTN049','Make the cue visible','For one Keeper, change the environment so it reminds you: put the phones away at dinner, leave walking shoes by the door, or add a private calendar cue.','A visible reminder means the Keeper does not depend on remembering at exactly the right moment.','KEEP',ARRAY['environmental_design','cue_association']::text[],ARRAY['home','workday','anywhere']::text[],3,1,false,false,'high','high','{"routine":1}'::jsonb,ARRAY[4]::integer[],ARRAY['privacy_or_shared_device_constraints']::text[],'{"anticipation":0.2,"shared_experience":0.2}'::jsonb),
('RTN050','Name what changed','Tonight, name one interaction that feels different from four weeks ago and the behavior that helped change it.','Naming what changed helps you see which behaviors are actually worth keeping.','NOTICE',ARRAY['reinforcement','self_monitoring']::text[],ARRAY['home','commuting','anywhere']::text[],3,1,false,false,'high','high','{"routine":1,"closeness":0.4}'::jsonb,ARRAY[4]::integer[],ARRAY[]::text[],'{"appreciation":0.8,"quality_attention":0.6}'::jsonb)
